{"id":"conv_04161","context":"A retired professor talks with a uni student about postwar history","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["ren_uni","hiroshi_elder"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"Professor, how did rural life actually change under the occupation?","jp":"先生、戦後の占領下で、農村部の生活は実際どう変わったんですか？","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,7,8,16,17,26,110,228,229,292,321,376,936,1922,2136,4858,4870,5964,8416],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先生","r":"せんせい","w":228},{"s":"、"},{"s":"戦後","r":"せんご","w":2136},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"占領","r":"せんりょう","w":4858},{"s":"下","r":"か","w":376},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"、"},{"s":"農村","r":"のうそん","w":4870},{"s":"部","r":"ぶ","w":321},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"生活","r":"せいかつ","w":229},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"実際","r":"じっさい","w":292},{"s":"どう","w":110},{"s":"変わっ","r":"かわっ","w":1922},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"か","w":16},{"s":"？"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"First came disarmament; the military vanished. Then civil administration was massively restructured.","jp":"まず武装解除があってな、軍隊が消えた。それから民事行政が大きく組み替えられたんだ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[4,6,8,12,21,22,26,84,170,370,591,672,679,1014,1988,2091,3390,4470,4686,4876,5134,6529,7581,7684],"jpTokens":[{"s":"まず","w":370},{"s":"武装","r":"ぶそう","w":4876},{"s":"解除","r":"かいじょ","w":3390},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"あっ","w":22},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"な","w":12},{"s":"、"},{"s":"軍隊","r":"ぐんたい","w":4686},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"消え","r":"きえ","w":7581},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"。"},{"s":"それから","w":672},{"s":"民事","r":"みんじ","w":4470},{"s":"行政","r":"ぎょうせい","w":679},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"大きく","r":"おおきく","w":1014},{"s":"組み替え","r":"くみかえ"},{"s":"られ","w":170},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"だ","w":21},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"ren_uni","mood":null,"en":"I see. The constitutional revision and education reforms were simultaneous, right?","jp":"なるほど。憲法の改正並びに教育制度の改革も同時期ですよね？","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,11,17,51,68,249,326,584,745,754,1052,109